sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Member
  participant B as Browser / Mobile
  participant API as Focused REST API
  participant OAuth as OAuth / OIDC Provider
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant R as Redis

  U->>B: Continue with Google
  B->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/oauth/google/start
  API-->>B: authorize URL + state + nonce
  B->>OAuth: Authorization request + PKCE challenge
  OAuth-->>API: callback with code + state
  API->>OAuth: Exchange code + verifier
  API->>DB: Upsert verified Google identity

  API->>DB: Create session + refresh-token family (hash only)
  API-->>B: Access JWT (5-10 min) + rotated refresh token
  Note over B: Browser refresh token is Secure, HttpOnly, SameSite cookie. Mobile stores it in OS keystore.

  B->>API: API request + Bearer access JWT
  API->>R: Check rate limit / revoked session marker
  API->>API: Verify signature, iss, aud, exp, sid, permissions
  API-->>B: Resource response

  B->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh
  API->>DB: Lock token family and compare token hash
  alt Valid current token
    API->>DB: Revoke used token and create successor
    API-->>B: New access JWT + refresh token
  else Replayed or replaced token
    API->>DB: Revoke entire token family and session
    API->>R: Mark session revoked
    API-->>B: 401 reauthentication_required
  end
